              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkeethĩwa, ethĩwa akakwĩa, Ndiuma kwaku; nĩkwĩthĩwa nũkwendete we na nyũmba yaku, nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩwoneaa ũseo kwaku; ",
          "type": "text",
